WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.324
Mr. Grill's plow was broken.

2
00:00:10.325 --> 00:00:14.055
"Oh no," said Eddy.

3
00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:20.261
"This is bad," said Mr. Grill.

4
00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:24.233
The snow got deeper.

5
00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:31.918
The snow piles got bigger.

6
00:00:31.919 --> 00:00:36.210
"How will we drive home?" said Poppy.

7
00:00:36.211 --> 00:00:42.408
Jeb rolled over to Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:46.357
"I can help," said Jeb.

9
00:00:46.358 --> 00:00:49.410
Mr. Grill smiled.

10
00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:52.623
"Yes, Jeb!" he said.

11
00:00:52.624 --> 00:01:00.755
"You have a scooper!"

12
00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:05.271
Jeb picked up some snow.

13
00:01:05.272 --> 00:01:14.509
He moved it away.

14
00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:17.891
Jeb scooped up more snow.

15
00:01:17.892 --> 00:01:24.057
Soon the snow piles were gone.

16
00:01:24.058 --> 00:01:27.605
"Way to go, Jeb!" said Eddy.

17
00:01:27.606 --> 00:01:32.623
"We can get to the road now!"

18
00:01:32.624 --> 00:01:36.839
A big snowplow truck drove by.

19
00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:43.742
He was clearing the road.

20
00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:47.579
He looked at Jeb and nodded.

21
00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:54.140
"Good job, kid," said the truck.

22
00:01:54.141 --> 00:02:01.470
Jeb grinned.

